OL,3,GNEWSAMan with the Pram honoured on
OL,4,Acity's walk of fame
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pram-pushing fundraiser who has
OL,7,Fcollected more than #1.2m for Macmillan
OL,8,FCancer Support has been honoured with a
OL,9,Fstar on the Sheffield Legends Walk of
OL,10,FFame.
OL,12,FThe plaque for John Burkhill, better
OL,13,Fknown as the Man with the Pram, was
OL,14,Funveiled outside Sheffield Town Hall.
OL,16,FBurkhill has spent decades raising
OL,17,Fmoney for charity following the deaths
OL,18,Fof his wife from breast cancer in 1992,
OL,19,Fand his daughter Karen, who died the
OL,20,Fprevious year.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
