OL,3,GNEWSAMan with the Pram honoured on
OL,4,Acity's walk of fame
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking on Tuesday, Burkhill, who is
OL,7,Fknown for his bright green wig and
OL,8,Fhighly decorated pram, said he was
OL,9,F"incredibly proud and humbled" by the
OL,10,Frecognition.
